r.ee/neolumism","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:55:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692524","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4327060-1842212951311363","game_id":"steam-4327060","kind":"update","title":"Elzypon Update 2","summary":"Hello,I hope everyone is well. Today we reveal a trailer showcasing nearly every aspect of Elzypon (Combat, Navigation, Some UI, Character Interactions etc.)You can check it out below or on instagram ( @Neolumism)Thanks so much for the support. We're currently at 7k wishlists, very much hoping to hit 10k by the time Next Fest starts!If you haven't seen already, we'll be running a kickstarter in tandem with the demo premiere during next fest. We'll be attempting to raise $20k to cover the remaind","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T20:14:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4327060-1835236783562423","game_id":"steam-4327060","kind":"update","title":"Elzypon Update","summary":"Hello,I just wanted to give a quick update regarding Elzypon.Firstly, we have a playable game loop. We're currently balancing combat, importing/ assigning assets, and optimizing where we can every day.Secondly, a playable demo is being prepared for the Steam Next Fest in October 2026 In conjunction with a Kickstarter that'll help with getting everything wrapped up by mid-2027.Below is a screenshot from an animation I recently finished that discusses the lore for the 3rd world, Netzach/ Venus. Yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T05:10:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.